%% alt: Each agent run emits spans for the agent, model calls, tool calls, retrieval and guardrails. A collector redacts and samples them into traces and metrics (tokens, cost, latency, errors). Online evals score sampled traces; scores and metrics feed dashboards and alerts, and selected traces go to a review queue and become new eval cases.
flowchart TB
  A[Agent run]:::model --> S[Spans: agent, model call,<br/>tool call, retrieval, guardrail]:::tool
  S --> C[Collector<br/>redact, sample]:::control
  C --> T[(Traces)]:::data
  C --> M[(Metrics: tokens, cost,<br/>latency, errors)]:::data
  T --> E[Online evals<br/>score samples]:::control
  T --> R[Review queue,<br/>new eval cases]:::human
  E & M --> D[Dashboards<br/>and alerts]:::tool
